@startuml backend-api
title Backend - API and Services
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam linetype ortho

component "app.py\n- FastAPI composition root" as app
component "API router layer\n\n- Personas\n- Discussions and templates\n- Configurations\n- Environment\n- Results" as api
component "Application service layer\n\n- PersonaService\n- DiscussionService\n- DiscussionTemplateService\n- ConfigurationService\n- EnvironmentService\n- ResultService\n- DelphiAnalyzer\n- PromptService" as services
component "Discussion Engine\n\n- LangGraph orchestration\n- Persona turns\n- Moderator and summaries" as engine
component "models.py\n-Pydantic API contracts" as models

app --> api : mounts /api
api --> models : validates requests
api --> services : delegates use cases
services --> models : creates responses
services --> engine : starts discussions

note right of api
The router layer exposes the HTTP
interface and contains no domain logic.
end note

note right of services
The service layer coordinates persistence,
configuration, result projection and analysis.
end note

@enduml

